Fix Overtime always falling through to the flat night roll

Overtime's event branch drained `overtime_event_pool`, left permanently
empty when the old ot_* events were scrapped — so "Take the shift" never
fired an event and always hit the generic flat fallback roll.

Wire it to the shared `random_event_pool` (the 10 ev_* events): Overtime
and the daily random-event slot now draw from one pool, no repeats across
either. Also reset that pool per run in init_game — it never refreshed
between playthroughs before.

refactor-judge: pass.

